### ==============================================================================
### DriveVue AI - Stripe Payment Gateway Checkout API Tests
### ==============================================================================
### Run each step sequentially using the VS Code REST Client extension
### Server URL: http://localhost:5000
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentType = application/json

### ==============================================================================
### STEP 1: Auth Login (Dynamically populates @userToken)
### ==============================================================================
# @name userLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "rahim@example.com",
  "password": "123456password"
}

### Extracted Auth Token from Login Response
@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.token}}

### ==============================================================================
### STEP 2: Fetch User's Pending Bookings (Dynamically populates @bookingId)
### ==============================================================================
# @name getMyBookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/my-bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Extracted Booking ID from user's booking list
@bookingId = {{getMyBookings.response.body.data[0]._id}}

### ==============================================================================
### OPTIONAL STEP 2B: Create a New Booking (Run if no pending bookings exist)
### ==============================================================================
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "car": "6ad3d9391803abf824b67ff0",
  "startDate": "2026-12-15",
  "endDate": "2026-12-18"
}

### ==============================================================================
### STEP 3: Create Stripe Checkout Session
### ==============================================================================
# @name createCheckoutSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/create-checkout-session
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "bookingId": "{{bookingId}}"
}

### Extracted Stripe Checkout Session ID from checkout response
@sessionId = {{createCheckoutSession.response.body.sessionId}}

### ==============================================================================
### STEP 4: Verify Payment (After checkout redirect or simulation)
### ==============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/verify-payment
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "bookingId": "{{bookingId}}",
  "simulatePayment": true
}

### ==============================================================================
### STEP 5: Check Booking Details (Confirmed & Paid)
### ==============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/my-bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ==============================================================================
### STEP 6: Validation Error Tests
### ==============================================================================

### 6.1 Missing bookingId -> Expected: 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/create-checkout-session
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
}

###

### 6.2 Invalid bookingId format -> Expected: 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/create-checkout-session
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "bookingId": "invalid-mongo-id"
}
